				<div class="et_pb_text_inner"><h2>Types of Air Conditioning Systems</h2>
<p>Choosing the right AC system is one of the most important decisions a homeowner can make. An undersized unit will struggle to cool the home efficiently, while an oversized system short-cycles and wastes energy. We take a consultative approach to every installation, evaluating the home’s square footage, insulation, ductwork, and existing infrastructure before recommending a solution that fits both the space and the budget. Before installing or replacing a system, it helps to know what’s actually available. Here’s a plain-language breakdown of the main types:</p></div>
			</div>
			</div>
				
				
				
				
			</div><div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_1 et_pb_equal_columns et_pb_gutters2">
