						<h3 class="et_pb_module_header"><span>Window</span></h3>
						<div class="et_pb_blurb_description">A single unit that fits into a window frame. Cheap and easy to install — a good fit for a small bedroom or studio, though it blocks part of the window and can get noisy.</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_4 et_pb_column_2 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough">
				
				
				
				
