						<h3 class="et_pb_module_header"><span>Split</span></h3>
						<div class="et_pb_blurb_description">A wall-mounted indoor unit paired with an outdoor condenser. Quiet and efficient — a strong pick for apartments or living rooms.</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_4 et_pb_column_3 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough">
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_2 et_pb_text_align_center et_pb_blurb_position_top et_pb_bg_layout_light">
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_blurb_content">
					
					<div class="et_pb_blurb_container">
						<h3 class="et_pb_module_header"><span>Portable</span></h3>
						<div class="et_pb_blurb_description">A floor-standing unit on wheels, vented through a window. Convenient for renters, but not as powerful as a split system.</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_4 et_pb_column_4 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child">
				
				
				
				
