				<div class="et_pb_text_inner"><h2>What Size AC System Do I Need?</h2>
<p>AC sizing is measured in tons and calculated based on square footage, ceiling height, insulation quality, window count, and climate. An average DFW home requires between 2 and 5 tons of cooling capacity. We perform a Manual J load calculation on every installation to ensure the system is precisely sized — not guessed. Getting this wrong in either direction costs you: an undersized system struggles to keep up, while an oversized one short-cycles, wastes energy, and wears out faster.</p></div>
