				<div class="et_pb_text_inner"><h2>Warranties on New Installations</h2>
<p>New AC installations come with both a manufacturer’s equipment warranty and our workmanship guarantee. Trane systems typically include a 10-year parts warranty when registered within 60 days of installation. We also assist customers in navigating warranty claims if any issues arise after installation. New systems generally include manufacturer warranties covering parts for 5–10 years, and we register the warranty and explain the coverage terms.</p></div>
