				<div class="et_pb_text_inner"><h2>Maintaining Your New AC System</h2>
<p>The most important maintenance task a homeowner can perform is replacing the air filter every 1 to 3 months. Keeping the outdoor condenser coil clean and free of debris also helps performance. We recommend annual maintenance for all AC systems, including newly installed units — ideally a seasonal tune-up in spring before peak cooling demand. We offer an annual maintenance plan for $120 per year.</p></div>
