				<h4 class="et_pb_toggle_title">How long does an air conditioning installation take?</h4>
				<div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix">Most residential installations take 4 to 8 hours; a standard system swap typically takes a full day. New construction or ductwork modifications may take longer. We provide a time estimate before work begins.</div>
