				<h4 class="et_pb_toggle_title">Is a cracked heat exchanger dangerous?</h4>
				<div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix">Yes — cracked heat exchangers can leak carbon monoxide, a deadly gas, and require immediate attention, often necessitating furnace replacement for safety.</div>
